# Library Shrinker

An iOS app for reviewing and compressing videos in the Photos library using H.264 or HEVC.

The app supports ratio- and bitrate-based targets, compressed-copy tracking, storage checks, album preservation, and safe original deletion.

## Requirements

- Xcode 26.6 or later
- iOS 26.5 or later

## Testing

Run the `Library Shrinker` scheme tests in Xcode or with `xcodebuild test` using an iOS Simulator destination.
